  m_text: "When you use our app, make sure you are aware of your surroundings. You
    have some help along the game,use the <u>hint</u> button so our <u>professor</u>
    can help you for the next position. If this is hard, use the <u>solution</u>
    so the stray <u>cat</u> will help you with the exact position since cats know
    everything. \n\nEnjoy the History in the streets of Valletta!"
